        <string>Two-cut structural source prototype. The explicit flat-foot replacement is an intentional body cost. Rounded transition, swash weight, native edge bearings, all-cut roles and actual target-size spacing require later review. Smoothstep control-point fitting is not a C1 curve guarantee.</string>
